<title>USA: Johnson Controls votes two-for-one split.</title>
<headline>Johnson Controls votes two-for-one split.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE, Wis. 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Johnson Controls Inc said Wednesday its board approved a two-for-one split of common shares to be distributed March 31, record March 7.</p>
<p>Directors also voted a regular quarterly cash payout of $0.43 a share, which will be paid as $0.215 on a post-split basis. The dividend is payable March 31, 1997, record March 7.</p>
<p>Johnson Controls is a global manufacturer of automotive systems and controls.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
